<title>INDIA: India ONGC 96/97 net 19.75 bln rupees.</title>
<headline>India ONGC 96/97 net 19.75 bln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's state-run Oil and Natural Gas Corp (ONGC) posted net profit of 19.75 billion rupees in 1996/97 (April-March), up slightly from 19.45 billion in the previous year, United News of India (UNI) said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>ONGC's sales stood at 132 billion rupees in 1996/97, the news agency reported. It gave no comparative figure.</p>
<p>ONGC supplied 17,310.34 million cubic metres of natural gas to consumers in various parts of the country, UNI said.</p>
<p>Seven major projects worth 21.9 billion rupees are being currently implemented by the company, it added.</p>
<p>--New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
